      "message": "[error] Line 887: 🔴 `deletionPermission()` returns `null` for `CALL` and `COLLAB_DOC`, which makes `canDeleteMessage()` return `true` and `requireMessageDeletion()` a no-op for those interactions. In swarm conversations this allows delete actions to bypass `delete` grant enforcement for those message types. Map these types to `Permission.Delete` (or explicitly reject deletion) so all remote deletions are permission-gated by default.",
